# Build-context allowlist for deploy/compose/Dockerfile. BuildKit reads a
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile, so this applies to that
# build only. Everything is excluded, then only what the build copies is
# admitted: no .venv, .tools, dist, keys or local state reach the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!sentinel/
!fixtures/cara/
!fixtures/cara_cases.json
!fixtures/omm/
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
